WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.344 --> 00:00:03.887
(cheerful music)

00:00:03.887 --> 00:00:06.675
- You know, there's summer
and spring and winter,

00:00:06.675 --> 00:00:08.930
but fall is definitely the best season,

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:10.452
and I'm gonna tell you why.

00:00:10.452 --> 00:00:12.393
Fall means sweater weather.

00:00:12.393 --> 00:00:14.219
Everyone looks good in sweaters.

00:00:14.219 --> 00:00:15.834
Look at this tiny human girl.

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:17.059
That should be you.

00:00:17.059 --> 00:00:18.041
Let's get real.

00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:20.936
Pumpkin spice is awesome
and goes with everything.

00:00:20.936 --> 00:00:23.434
Grab yourself a steamy
cup of pumpkin spice latte

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:24.808
and treat yourself.

00:00:24.808 --> 00:00:26.667
Fall also means county
fairs are popping up

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:27.775
left and right.

00:00:27.775 --> 00:00:28.608
They are fun.

00:00:28.608 --> 00:00:29.441
They are cheap.

00:00:29.441 --> 00:00:30.850
Go grab yourself some funnel cake.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:32.317
Go ride that Ferris Wheel.

00:00:32.317 --> 00:00:34.400
Look at how pretty it is.

00:00:35.381 --> 00:00:37.421
Don't tell me you forgot
about Thanksgiving.

00:00:37.421 --> 00:00:38.477
That is the best.

00:00:38.477 --> 00:00:39.973
You get to eat so much food

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.925
with so many people that you like.

00:00:41.925 --> 00:00:45.396
Look. (murmuring)

00:00:45.396 --> 00:00:46.749
Look at this lady.

00:00:46.749 --> 00:00:49.814
She has never been happier
in her entire life,

00:00:49.814 --> 00:00:52.613
and that's because the trees
go from normal looking things

00:00:52.613 --> 00:00:54.613
into majestic creatures.

00:00:55.532 --> 00:00:57.568
I said that, yes.

00:00:57.568 --> 00:00:58.882
Hey, if you're allergic to the outdoors

00:00:58.882 --> 00:01:00.389
and can't do all of that, guess what?

00:01:00.389 --> 00:01:02.631
Fall means great stuff indoors too.

00:01:02.631 --> 00:01:03.464
Fall TV,

00:01:04.594 --> 00:01:06.103
oh my gosh, girl,

00:01:06.103 --> 00:01:08.083
what are we watching tonight?

00:01:08.083 --> 00:01:09.012
Is it Shonda?

00:01:09.012 --> 00:01:09.845
There you have it,

00:01:09.845 --> 00:01:12.796
so many reasons why fall
is the best season ever.

00:01:12.796 --> 00:01:13.629
Don't mind me.

00:01:13.629 --> 00:01:14.608
I'm gonna go eat some pumpkin bread

00:01:14.608 --> 00:01:16.030
and plant some leaves.

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:17.030
You can too.

00:01:18.331 --> 00:01:19.463
See ya out there.

00:01:19.463 --> 00:01:22.213
(cheerful music)

